&nbsp;

00:11:22.800 --> 00:11:27.360
SIERRA: So satellites go&nbsp;
down, and we lose our GPS.
&nbsp;

00:11:27.360 --> 00:11:29.600
THOMPSON: Correct.
SIERRA: We lose our weather prediction,&nbsp;&nbsp;

