and we lose our streaming Netflix.
THOMPSON: Right.
&nbsp;

00:11:32.560 --> 00:11:34.320
SIERRA: Not good stuff.
THOMPSON: What is there left to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:34.320 --> 00:11:35.960
do? That’s right. 
SIERRA:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:36.480 --> 00:11:41.840
Netflix aside, let’s be clear. A widespread&nbsp;
satellite failure could be catastrophic.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:43.200 --> 00:11:48.000
So many different systems depend on satellites&nbsp;
that nobody has a full picture of what the fallout&nbsp;&nbsp;

