stock market might be shut down.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:58.080 --> 00:12:03.040
Sure, space junk is circling a thousand&nbsp;
miles above our heads, but the problems it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:03.040 --> 00:12:09.760
might cause are very much down here on Earth. 
Patrick: I think that outer space is a great realm&nbsp;&nbsp;

