would one day be launching thousands of private&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:02.560 --> 00:14:09.520
satellites. Space has changed since 1967. And this&nbsp;
has left experts thinking about new rules. 
&nbsp;

00:14:09.520 --> 00:14:15.520
PATRICK: I think one of the answers is that you&nbsp;
