00:14:15.520 --> 00:14:19.920
and you need to have as much ability to monitor&nbsp;
whether or not people are living up to their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:19.920 --> 00:14:25.600
commitments. And I think that that’s been one of&nbsp;
the most difficult things in outer space generally&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:25.600 --> 00:14:31.520
because, obviously, it’s a domain that’s far away&nbsp;
and it’s not easily observable as to how countries&nbsp;&nbsp;

